1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,425
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:04,375 --> 00:00:06,928
Helpers work in the back.

3
00:00:06,928 --> 00:00:09,481
Sammy has photos.

4
00:00:09,481 --> 00:00:11,489
Eddie mixes.

5
00:00:11,489 --> 00:00:13,882
Lulu scoops ice.

6
00:00:13,882 --> 00:00:15,478
Oh no!

7
00:00:15,478 --> 00:00:18,311
Visitors walk into the back.

8
00:00:18,311 --> 00:00:20,678
Eddie drops a pitcher.

9
00:00:20,678 --> 00:00:23,351
Winn is the ticket window.

10
00:00:23,351 --> 00:00:25,997
Come to the window first.

11
00:00:25,997 --> 00:00:28,018
Ask nicely.

12
00:00:28,018 --> 00:00:29,787
Get a ticket.

13
00:00:29,787 --> 00:00:32,965
Winn passes it to the right helper.

14
00:00:32,965 --> 00:00:35,146
Helpers are calm.

15
00:00:35,146 --> 00:00:37,327
A crowd rushes.

16
00:00:37,327 --> 00:00:39,760
Winn holds up a hand.

17
00:00:39,760 --> 00:00:41,156
Wait.

18
00:00:41,156 --> 00:00:43,364
A few at a time.

19
00:00:43,364 --> 00:00:45,106
No ticket?

20
00:00:45,106 --> 00:00:47,406
Winn shakes her head.

21
00:00:47,406 --> 00:00:49,468
Seal glows.

22
00:00:49,468 --> 00:00:52,234
Only real friends get in.

23
00:00:52,234 --> 00:00:56,821
Ask at the window, get a ticket, wait your turn.

24
00:00:56,821 --> 00:00:58,803
Maya waves.

25
00:00:58,803 --> 00:01:01,037
Now you know Winn!

26
00:01:01,037 --> 00:01:05,731
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

